---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="GeoFileTools privacy policy — your files are processed locally in your browser and never uploaded to our servers."
>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12 px-4">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <section class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">Files you convert</h2>
        <p>GeoFileTools processes your files <strong>locally in your browser</strong>. Your original files and converted output stay on your device. We do not upload, store, transmit, or retain any of your data on our servers.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">No account required</h2>
        <p>You can use all conversion tools without creating an account or providing any personal information.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">Cookies</h2>
        <p>GeoFileTools does not use cookies to track or identify users. We may use essential session cookies to maintain basic site functionality.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">Third-party services</h2>
        <p>We use Cloudflare to serve this website and ensure security and performance. Cloudflare may log IP addresses and browser metadata in accordance with their <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">privacy policy</a>. We also use Google Analytics (or equivalent) to understand how visitors use the site — no personal data is collected.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">Advertisements</h2>
        <p>We display Google AdSense advertisements on this website. Google may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">External links</h2>
        <p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those sites.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at the email address listed on this website.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
